 "summary": "The new public surface is small and its bodies are hidden: `bundleTensorEquivOfNeZero` has `@[simp]` apply and symm-apply lemmas, and every `lineCoord` caller (Trivialization.lean, TensorProduct/Line.lean, PointTwist/Divisor.lean) passes the new `hF` argument, with no alias left behind. `TensorProduct.inCoordinates_pullback` uses the root `TensorProduct` namespace that `inCoordinates` already uses (TensorProduct/Basic.lean:41), and `linearMapAt_pullback` is `@[simp]` like the pullback lemmas next to it.",
